# Wave W17-Y (Route 214): verge sand — meadow-road pale sand, design-authorised: a pale sand running the lake’s north shore to Shardfall’s gate with the Vernal lane leaving east off it (design: Shardfall to the Gallant lakefront, the green lane east). Split from the Vernal Path’s hushed sand beside it by traffic entire — this is the through road, that the branch — and from Lake Gallant’s shore sand south of it by the meadow: rim sand vs verge sand.
